Z||000000||FieroKyle||10-14-2001||12:47 AM||||First Time I drove the car all week..... I was heading home after I rented a movie and washed the car to later on head over to my girlfriend's house. Well, I was going and all the sudden truck pulls out infront of me and I veer off the road and still gets me. It was a late 70's Chevy Pick-em-up truck. Hit me driver's side right behind the tire. Hit about going 35 mph. Turns out its a kid I go to school with in my class. So anyway to make a long story short, He got a ticket, I have a wrecked Fiero, not totalled, held up really well. I am suprised I didn't get a ticket since I didn't have a seat belt on. I was planning on driving it another month till I put up for winter but, it looks like its gonna be early. Don't worry, car is fully covered and I know a place that will fix it up great, should look good for next summer when its get out of the body shop. I have to call the insurance company monday to get this thing all figured out. But I am still really pissed about it though, but no one got hurt so thats good too. ||||reg||8
